{"id":"escalera","lemma":"escalera","pos":"noun","rank":1557,"glosses":["stairs","staircase, stairway","ladder"],"ipa":"/eskaˈleɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"escaleras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-escalera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sube las escaleras.","en":"Go up the stairs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442445","words":[{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Necesito una escalera.","en":"I need a ladder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441826","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Baja por las escaleras.","en":"Go down the stairs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523566","words":[{"g":"casualty, loss"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"No necesitamos una escalera.","en":"We don't need a ladder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/195610","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella bajó las escaleras.","en":"She went down the stairs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524856","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to go down, come down","l":"bajar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}